@startuml
title Farm Management System State Diagram

[*] --> LoggedOut

state LoggedOut
state LoggedIn
state "Market Conditions" as MarketConditions
state "Pest Control Help" as PestControlHelp
state "Soil Suggestions" as SoilSuggestions
state "Weather Insights" as WeatherInsights
state "Labour Availability" as LabourAvailability

LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : User Login / Authentication Successful

LoggedIn --> MarketConditions : Select Market Conditions / Display Report
LoggedIn --> PestControlHelp : Select Pest Control Help / Request Photo
LoggedIn --> SoilSuggestions : Select Soil Suggestions / Provide Soil Information
LoggedIn --> WeatherInsights : Select Weather Insights / Provide Location
LoggedIn --> LabourAvailability : Select Labour Availability / Provide Location

MarketConditions --> LoggedIn : View Report / Return to Main Menu
PestControlHelp --> LoggedIn : Provide Photo / Display Techniques
SoilSuggestions --> LoggedIn : Receive Soil Information / Display Suggestions
WeatherInsights --> LoggedIn : Receive Location / Display Insights
LabourAvailability --> LoggedIn : Receive Location / Display Availability

LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : User Logout / End Session

@enduml
